WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,830 --> 00:00:02,910
Really chicken feet of the sea

2
00:00:02,910 --> 00:00:05,030
I remember the scientific name of this thing is Ejinteng Lake

3
00:00:05,030 --> 00:00:05,990
Originated in Europe

4
00:00:05,990 --> 00:00:07,390
It must have been the 1990s

5
00:00:07,390 --> 00:00:08,870
Only appeared in our waters

6
00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:09,870
How could it be ten years in advance?

7
00:00:09,870 --> 00:00:11,510
Appeared in the Yellow Sea

8
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:12,550
Never mind it

9
00:00:12,550 --> 00:00:14,350
This thing belongs to high-end seafood

10
00:00:14,350 --> 00:00:15,950
Since I'm lucky enough to meet

11
00:00:15,950 --> 00:00:19,220
I definitely can’t let it go

12
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:21,100
The surface of the reef is washed away by seawater all year round.

13
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:23,140
Very smooth if you climb on it

14
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,580
Encountering a huge wave again

15
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:26,340
People can easily die

16
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:45,700
There shouldn’t be any tides in a short period of time

17
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:48,610
There must be one or two more

18
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:50,880
If a pound can be sold for ten yuan

19
00:00:50,960 --> 00:01:03,180
This one must have a piece

20
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:05,060
I can't see clearly when I'm down there

21
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:06,100
I didn’t expect there were many more up there

22
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:07,420
Hands similar to sea chicken feet
